{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_06",
  "title": "中央通道",
  "storyCode": "SN-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cb9c34ea1b1c52c9627abc71d20a1d9ea7798cb4fb7deb6fd38522f97b67ffa3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布雷奥甘，是那把钥匙的主人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在伊比利亚的黄金时代成为了王公贵族的座上宾，人们曾一度以为他象征着阿戈尔岛民与伊比利亚人和谐共处的开端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没人知道他在灾难前做了什么，又来不及做什么，但是他确确实实留下了足够多的遗产......以及对你们来说，足够多的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他已经属于过去，毫无疑问，现在做出选择的是你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那把钥匙......布雷奥甘的钥匙遗落在卡西米尔的缘由，是一个我们没必要知晓的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但找到它的，是猎人斯卡蒂。这不是什么巧合，这是必然。你们对海洋天生敏感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的，我把钥匙交给了那个乐队。你会知道她们是什么样的存在。也许阿戈尔人需要争取她们的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她们也在寻找答案。她们大多年轻，也对海洋的变化感到不适，毕竟她们无法真正离开自己诞生的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊......希望我们能够成功。人类有太多问题需要面对，层层累叠的灾难可以轻松撕毁现在的文明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅，你想单独行动，我不会劝阻你。斯卡蒂与你相似，也许猎人都是相似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但千万别觉得，自己能解决陆地上的所有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你问吧，对你，我有问必答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ishar-mla......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在哪里听到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g24_cloudy_sea"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们就快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，海洋......太宽广了，模糊的坐标会带来极大的误差......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......而且海洋比我想的要平静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过于平静了，离开那座灯塔后，我们遭遇的袭击反而变得更少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至......没有风浪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这意味着什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这意味着——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可怜的小鸟，你在紧张吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀！你、你什么时候——别站在我背后！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没有紧张，我只是......很少很少有人能深入海洋到这个地步，我......我不确定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你在凝视身后，而非眼前。你在害怕失去，而不是面对未知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的长官为你创造了前往斯图提斐拉的契机，接触阿戈尔的契机，不是为了让你这么优柔寡断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你得在战斗来临之前......唔。鲨鱼，你闻到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，让这艘舒适的小船微微向右，我们就能看见那艘更大的船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里已经是一座巢穴，我们真的要去那里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽灵鲨，你要不要休息一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？我有什么不对的地方吗？为什么这么问？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的手在抖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幽灵鲨看向自己的手。没有握着武器的手，正在海风中微微颤抖。\n她的意识逐渐明晰，又极快地坠入深海，触碰不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......啊，我这是在激动吗？还是......感动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅默默握住了幽灵鲨的手，斯卡蒂随之效仿，三名深海猎人沉默了片刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欢迎回家。猎人们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅默默地走上船头。\n海风推开夜晚，传递着熟悉的气味。\n一艘安静的大船，在海面上酣眠沉睡。它是海风的臣民，时代的贵客。\n而那曾是一个遍地理想的时代，人们的探索精神在它身上体现得淋漓尽致，傲慢亦然。\n斯卡蒂与歌蕾蒂娅无声地眺望着那艘船。\n一瞬间她们想起了很多，但最后无疑都回到了自己的过去，童年，故土，与当下船舶摇晃的频率。\n唯有幽灵鲨微微抱紧了手里的武器，海风微拂。\n海风会把猎人们带回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沿石面爬行的窸窣声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr，烧毁它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尖啸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡门阁下，我们没有太多时间停留在这里。猎人们的队伍会有危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惩戒军被束缚住了脚步，看来我还是低估了深海教会的渗透程度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们本该在格兰法洛清理出一片临时阵地后再跟上他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们别无选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果无法确保格兰法洛，就意味着我们会腹背受敌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个伊比利亚大阵至少有十个连队，三千人规模，惩戒军中的幕僚们足以指挥他们赢下这场战争。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你对惩戒军似乎颇为了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们打过不少交道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么你的意思是，我们将格兰法洛交给惩戒军，先行前往伊比利亚之眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我们面对的是维多利亚的舰队，我并不反对这个提案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否则我们的损失将更加惨重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（独奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frost女士？你为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她说，这叫体能训练。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们来自海洋。我们就是海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然......（悲怆的独奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果你们愿意帮忙，那么再好不过。你能做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让它们听话。听我唱歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的同伴们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，Dan想借用那座礼拜堂。她们都在那里思考新的曲子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "音乐？你们的音乐和以前我在莱塔尼亚所听到的大不相同，你们会对这种东西感兴趣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（紧凑的独奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "音乐，才是生活的意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想在演出开始前，清场而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Frost缓缓取出了她的吉他。\n卡门略感讶异。他能感觉到面前这个生物确确实实在思考名为“音乐”的艺术。她的话语里没有任何多余的用意。\n音乐绝非比喻。将这个词用以比喻其他事物都会让Frost分心。她只考虑音乐，这种能取悦她灵魂的艺术才能引起她的注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（畏缩的窸窣声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尝试性的独奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那些潜藏着的恐鱼，环绕在她的身旁，观察，审视，判断。\n它们不敢轻易靠近。它们嗅到了熟悉的味道。它们意识到眼前的吉他手只是空壳。她悠远的联系在它们血脉馈赠的深处隐隐作响。\n即使这里仍是陆地，它们却在瞬间感觉自己回到了海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（困惑打转的窸窣声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多么......神奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些与大地本身息息相关的生物，在它们眼中，人类与恐鱼是否毫无区别？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Frost没有回答，她对旋律如痴如醉，对激情本身要求严苛。\n凯尔希知道，这个问题是问自己的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希，这也在你的盘算之中？让她们坐镇海岸，让惩戒军深入大海？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您愿意这么想，那我就是这么想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是惩戒军甚至没来得及为我们准备好一艘船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海岸上还有一艘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从格兰法洛计划废止开始，它已经等了很多年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......必须先斩断留在陆地上的恶根。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是一名审判官。我不会坐视潜伏在伊比利亚的邪恶在我眼前溜走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g21_goldenboat_deck"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "松、松手，别这么抱着我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是不抱着你，孱弱的小鸟，你根本没法爬上这么高的甲板呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不是这个意思——啧，算了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "审判官艾丽妮只是怔怔地看着眼前的景色。\n漆黑的海面，昏暗的光线。六十年的时间仿佛在船桅处停滞不前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里就是......斯图提斐拉，“愚人号”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "满载学者与军人的旗舰，陨落王族在海洋上的行宫......和书本上的记录......差别很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等、等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这艘船这么大，你要在这里找什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布雷奥甘是个阿戈尔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这把钥匙，一定藏着一个阿戈尔人想要留下的线索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钥匙？那么锁在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正打算找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么大艘船，六十年就这么漂泊在海上，你打算怎么找——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许你这样年轻的伊比利亚人没有接触过太多这样的运输工具。即使有布雷奥甘的协助，它也被制造得如此粗糙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一路走来，海洋是否温柔，你心里有数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么我倒想请教你一个问题，这艘船，“为什么没沉”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "脚步声。沉重的，黏稠的脚步声。\n在这本不该有什么活物的甲板上，出现了一道影子。\n不，艾丽妮立刻斥责了自己的想法。歌蕾蒂娅的质询同时也是疑问。岸上，海里，她已经见过了那么多的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在看清敌人的一瞬，天赋异禀的年轻审判官艾丽妮，本能的反应是，窒息。\n而在她回想起如何呼吸的时候，歌蕾蒂娅已经一步上前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——（尖锐的咆哮）——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然能躲开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它想逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想都别想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它躲到了船舱里！我们要追吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的，它躲到了船舱里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可它怎么会躲进船舱里？这里可是海的中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止一只。这艘船上不止一只海嗣。恐鱼更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们得分头行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们去追。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我向下走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向、向下，你们怎么知道这艘船的构造——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道，切开就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......这可是伊比利亚先贤最重要的遗产！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢，小鸟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我有义务监视你们，我和你们一起走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯图提斐拉上有很多谜题，它既然能保存得这么完整，为什么六十年间从没试过回到伊比利亚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身为伊比利亚的审判官，我必须得到真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要牵着手吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你什么意思？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是一颗才华的果实，但和你的敌人相比，你的努力和天资都变得不值一提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我担心一个不留神，我们就失去你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别太瞧不起人，阿戈尔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就交给你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鲨鱼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想起了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......海风告诉我，告诉我，有一座雕塑。它在哭泣，它在等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以在这艘船上找到它吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，快些吧，鲨鱼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我等着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雕塑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我们一边欢迎死者，一边找找它藏身的地方吧，斯卡蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真高兴你还记得我的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g23_goldenboat_pass"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真是......富丽堂皇的风格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，怎么会这么干净......这里纤尘不染，看，地板甚至在反光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许是有人坚持打扫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们说要追踪那只怪物，你们真的追得到它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "气味不会骗人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尽管这里尽是腐臭的味道，肯定有不少——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（勤劳的窸窣声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐鱼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里果然被这些怪物当作巢穴了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（在原地打转的窸窣声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——等等！幽灵鲨！气味在我们脚下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ishar-mla。\nIshar-mla。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g22_goldenboat_hall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，刚才的冲击......幽灵鲨，还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......幽灵鲨？劳伦缇娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在看什么？镜子？这里怎么会有一面镜子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......镜子被打碎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是怎么回事？伊比利亚人的水上运输工具需要一座宫殿吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和罗德岛差别真大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这面镜子有什么特别的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "起初，那是这面破碎镜台的点点亮光。很快，这点点光亮化作了实影，那是它的眼。\n海嗣早在这里等待。孤坐在这黄金的大厅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Ishar-mla，La-tina，Louu-tina，Laren-tina......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这只幼小的......不，它们不能用体形判断力量。它是海嗣，又一只，毫无疑问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有恐鱼，恐鱼群正在聚集！幽灵鲨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幽灵鲨置若罔闻。她怔怔看着镜子。和镜子后的海嗣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你记得我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海嗣微微点头。它困惑地看着幽灵鲨与斯卡蒂。它在思考。\n为什么她们与“过去”不同？她们怎么了？怎么帮她们从累赘的血肉中解脱出来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽灵鲨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别乱想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没乱想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "语气变了。\n斯卡蒂惊讶地看着幽灵鲨。对于她在盐风城时所表露出的片刻清醒，斯卡蒂始终没能从歌蕾蒂娅或是凯尔希那里得到一个确切的答复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劳伦缇娜，你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劳伦缇娜，是啊，劳伦缇娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看，就在武器上的这一条经卷里，我写下自己的名字挂在上面的时候，我甚至还能记得我出生的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊......清醒的梦境。真是，又过了这么久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽灵鲨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，一会再感慨吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盐风城也好，这艘陌生又熟悉的水上运输工具也罢，真希望唤醒我的，是阿戈尔穹顶的光辉，而不是你们这些丑陋的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你安静地听我说完。等等，你不会也想开口称呼我们为同胞吧？怪别扭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧，你也小睡片刻如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沉进意识的泥沼，放弃生命的大权。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——（尖啸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
